title: National Day of Catalonia (2015)
view-if: year = 2015 and month = 9 and not rubicon
tags: event
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: diada2015_response = null
set-bg: img/diada/2010.jpg
face-image: img/diada/2015.jpg
role: event

= Free Way to the Catalan Republic

One more year, on the National Day of Catalonia, the ANC and Omnium Cultural are organizing a massive demonstration in Barcelona. This time, it is along the entire length of the Meridiana avenue: the "Free Way to the Catalan Republic".

- @join
- @force
- @pass

@join
title: Join the demonstration!
choose-if: player_roadmap > 0 and not broken_roadmap and (not ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or independence_trust >= 40)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if player_roadmap <= 0: We have no Roadmap to Independence. ?][? if broken_roadmap: Given our broken promises, we are unwelcome here. ?][? if ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and independence_trust < 40: The organization's lack of trust in our action in government makes us unwelcome here.  ?]
on-arrival: diada2015_response = "join"
go-to: report

@force
title: We'll join, and help out organizing so that it is a success!
subtitle: Our party apparatus will mobilize in force for this. \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: player_roadmap > 0 and not broken_roadmap and (not ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or independence_trust >= 40) and party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if player_roadmap <= 0: We have no Roadmap to Independence. ?][? if broken_roadmap: Given our broken promises, we are unwelcome here. ?][? if ((player_party = "erc" and erc_in_gob) or (player_party = "cup" and cup_in_gob) or (player_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (player_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and independence_trust < 40:  The organization's lack of trust in our action in government makes us unwelcome here. ?][? if party_resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: diada2015_response = "force"
go-to: report

@pass
title: Stay on the sidelines
on-arrival: diada2015_response = "pass"
go-to: report

@report
on-arrival: {!
    var response = Q.diada2015_response;
    var option = this.game.scenes['2015diada.' + response];
    // Check participation before the demonstration's own trust increase.
    if (Q.year == 2015 && Q.month == 9 && !Q.rubicon && option &&
        this._runPredicate(option.chooseIf, true)) {
        // Diada 2015 — "Via Lliure", overshadowed by the 27-S plebiscitary elections.
        // Effect AND street turnout decided dynamically from current state (existing Q
        // vars only). Model + rationale: simulations/diada_dynamics.py.
        var IM = Q.independence_movement, IT = Q.independence_trust;
        Q.diada2015_trust = IT;
        var SD = Q.social_dissent, CSR = Q.cat_spa_relations;
        var pod = Q.podemos_channeling || 0;
        var clamp = function (x, lo, hi) { return Math.max(lo, Math.min(hi, x)); };

        // Situational reads (existing bool flags; absent => false). A referendum/consulta
        // IS street action (mobilises); a caretaker government means an ordinary election
        // is near, which drains the marginal effect to the ballot — but still draws crowds.
        var mobilise = (Q.referendum_pending || Q.consultation_pending) ? 1 : 0;
        var channel  = Q.cat_caretaker_gov ? 1 : 0;

        // Magnitude: autonomous street floor (IM-IT gap, widest when parties haven't earned
        // trust) + mobilisation, amplified by antagonism, drained by an imminent election.
        var gap   = Math.max(0, IM - IT);
        var antag = clamp(1 + 0.5 * (40 - CSR) / 40, 0.4, 1.6);
        var mag   = clamp((1.5 + 0.18 * gap + 5.0 * mobilise) * antag * (1 - 0.45 * channel), 0, 16);

        // Valence: hope by default; grief (the sign flips) in the repression aftermath —
        // broken roadmap + relations on the floor + anger (dissent) still unspent.
        var grief = 0;
        if (Q.broken_roadmap) {
            grief = clamp((20 - CSR) / 15, 0, 1) * clamp((SD - 48) / 10, 0, 1);
        }
        var valence = 1 - 2 * grief;

        // Political effect (post_event clamps each variable afterwards).
        Q.independence_movement += mag * valence;
        Q.independence_trust    += 0.22 * mag * valence;
        Q.social_dissent        += -0.22 * mag * valence * (1 - 0.6 * pod);
        Q.cat_spa_relations     += -0.30 * mag;

        // Street turnout for flavour text, in millions of participants (display only).
        // Via Lliure remains large, but an ordinary caretaker election provides a
        // smaller draw than a referendum or consultation.
        var turnoutAnchor = 1.20;
        var stateAdjustment = clamp(
            0.008 * (IM - 60) + 0.006 * (gap - 25) + 0.004 * (40 - CSR),
            -0.35, 0.35
        );
        var voteBoost = 0.20 * mobilise + 0.05 * channel;
        Q.diada_size = clamp((turnoutAnchor + stateAdjustment + voteBoost) * (1 - 0.40 * grief), 0.2, 2.0);
        Q.diada_size = Math.round(Q.diada_size * 100) / 100;
        // Party participation adds to the autonomous mobilization above.
        if (response == "join" || response == "force") {
            var inGovernment = (Q.player_party == "erc" && Q.erc_in_gob) ||
                (Q.player_party == "cup" && Q.cup_in_gob) ||
                (Q.player_in_jxsi && Q.jxsi_in_gob) || (Q.player_in_jxcat && Q.jxcat_in_gob);
            var inForce = response == "force";
            if (inForce) Q.party_resources -= 1;
            Q.independence_movement += inForce ? 3 : 1;
            Q.cat_spa_relations -= inForce ? 5 : 1;
            if (inForce && inGovernment) Q.independence_trust += 3;
            Q.diada_size = Math.round(clamp(Q.diada_size * (inForce ? 1.10 : 1.05), 0.2, 2.0) * 100) / 100;
        }
    }
!}

One more year, the ANC and Omnium Cultural have filled the streets of Barcelona, loudly demanding independence. [+ diada_size +] million people have filled this time the entire length of the Meridiana avenue, with a whole organized show simbolizing the need to build, together, the way or the path to a new Catalan Republic. The Spanish Government reaction has been, still, to keep quiet about it. The only official reaction has been a tweet by Vicepresidenta Soraya Sáenz de Santamaría saying that "democracy is not only about going to the polls" and that "law and the ruling of the courts needs to be respected".

The protest was supported by [? if (diada2015_trust >= 40 or not (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob)): [+ parlament_current_ciu +], ?][? if ((player_party != "cup" or diada2015_response != "pass") and (diada2015_trust >= 40 or not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): the CUP, ?][? if ((player_party != "erc" or diada2015_response != "pass") and (diada2015_trust >= 40 or not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): ERC, ?][? if (diada2015_trust >= 40 or not (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob)) or ((player_party != "cup" or diada2015_response != "pass") and (diada2015_trust >= 40 or not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))) or ((player_party != "erc" or diada2015_response != "pass") and (diada2015_trust >= 40 or not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)))): and ?]many other minor parties and organizations.
[? if diada2015_trust < 40 and ((cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob) or (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) or (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))): The organizers made it clear that representatives of [? if (cat_coalition_includes_ciu or cat_coalition_includes_cdc or cat_coalition_includes_dl or cat_coalition_includes_pdcat or cat_coalition_includes_junts or jxsi_in_gob or jxcat_in_gob): [+ parlament_current_ciu +][? if (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)):,?] [? if ((erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and not (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))) or ((cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)) and not (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob))): and ?]?][? if (erc_in_gob or (erc_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (erc_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): ERC [? if (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): and ?]?][? if (cup_in_gob or (cup_in_jxsi and jxsi_in_gob) or (cup_in_jxcat and jxcat_in_gob)): the CUP ?]were not welcome, given the lack of commitment to independence while in government. ?]


- @riots
- @continue


@continue
title: Continue...
view-if: diada2015_trust >= 40 and not rubicon
go-to: post_event

@riots
title: Not everything is just a festive celebration, though...
view-if: diada2015_trust < 40 or rubicon
go-to: diada_riots